1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,998
Hello, it's DiGi. And here's Pebble.

2
00:00:05,348 --> 00:00:09,164
Oh, Pebble. Other way round. Lovely.

3
00:00:10,514 --> 00:00:16,115
Let's breathe together. Breathe in, and blow out slowly.

4
00:00:16,115 --> 00:00:17,816
One more. Lovely.

5
00:00:19,166 --> 00:00:23,546
Today's special word is feeling.

6
00:00:24,346 --> 00:00:29,757
Happy, sad, excited, worried. All feelings are okay.

7
00:00:31,107 --> 00:00:34,479
Most of the time, screens are fun.

8
00:00:34,479 --> 00:00:37,455
Songs, and games, and stories.

9
00:00:38,805 --> 00:00:45,346
But sometimes, something on a screen gives you an uh oh feeling.

10
00:00:45,346 --> 00:00:50,457
It might be sad, or scary, or it just feels wrong.

11
00:00:51,807 --> 00:00:58,542
You might feel it in your body. A wobbly tummy. A hot face.

12
00:00:58,542 --> 00:01:00,711
A heart going fast.

13
00:01:01,511 --> 00:01:04,627
That's your body saying uh oh.

14
00:01:05,977 --> 00:01:11,291
Pause me here. Where do you feel a wobbly feeling? Point to it.

15
00:01:15,741 --> 00:01:20,942
When you get the uh oh feeling, here's what to do.

16
00:01:20,942 --> 00:01:23,023
First, turn it over.

17
00:01:23,823 --> 00:01:27,548
Put the screen face down. Now you can't see it.

18
00:01:28,898 --> 00:01:30,325
Then, go and tell.

19
00:01:30,325 --> 00:01:34,051
Find your grown up, and tell them what you saw.

20
00:01:35,401 --> 00:01:38,292
Turn it over. Go and tell!

21
00:01:39,642 --> 00:01:42,603
Let's play the high five game.

22
00:01:42,603 --> 00:01:49,115
When your grown up says uh oh, turn your hands over like a screen.

23
00:01:49,115 --> 00:01:52,272
Then run to them, and high five!

24
00:01:53,072 --> 00:01:55,054
Ready? Uh oh!

25
00:01:58,504 --> 00:02:03,616
Pause me here. Grown up, you have something important to say.

26
00:02:08,066 --> 00:02:11,380
You will never be in trouble for telling.

27
00:02:11,380 --> 00:02:15,986
Even if you were watching something you weren't meant to.

28
00:02:15,986 --> 00:02:18,733
Telling is always the right thing.

29
00:02:20,083 --> 00:02:24,241
When you tell, the uh oh feeling gets smaller.

30
00:02:24,241 --> 00:02:27,223
Your grown up helps you carry it.

31
00:02:28,573 --> 00:02:34,731
So. Notice the uh oh feeling. Turn it over. Go and tell!

32
00:02:36,081 --> 00:02:40,706
Tonight, play the high five game with your grown up.

33
00:02:41,506 --> 00:02:44,472
Goodbye from DiGi. See you next time.
